本書逐章研讀提摩太前書全書六章，並附參考資料附錄，整合黃長老 Thursday 查經班筆記、John MacArthur 與 G. Campbell Morgan 教牧書信解經傳統，貫穿保羅寫給提摩太這封「門訓」書信的兩大部分——教會真理（1-3章）與傳道人的操練（4-6章）。全書以監督執事的品格資格為軸心，收束於「教會是真理的柱石和根基」（3:15）與「敬虔的奧祕」（3:16），並在末章以「持守所給你的託付」（6:20）作結，指向那忠心傳遞、世世代代不變的真道。

{\baskerville\color{CoverCream} A chapter-by-chapter study of all six chapters of 1 Timothy, with a references appendix, integrating Elder Wong's Thursday Bible study notes and the exegetical traditions of John MacArthur and G. Campbell Morgan on the Pastoral Epistles. The study traces Paul's two-part discipleship letter to Timothy --- church truth (chs. 1-3) and the minister's training (chs. 4-6) --- centered on the character qualifications for overseers and deacons, and culminating in "the church of the living God, a pillar and buttress of the truth" (3:15) and "the mystery of godliness" (3:16), closing with Paul's charge: "guard the deposit entrusted to you" (6:20).}
$endif$
\end{minipage}

